{
  "_notes": [
    "Passive cross-chain spread monitor (docs/fleet/xchain-monitor.md). Read-only: eth_chainId, eth_getCode, eth_call.",
    "RPC URLs are NOT here: they come from the env names below, set by Joshua in bots/wrapper/.env.",
    "Pools are not hard-coded: at start (and every resolveEveryMin) the monitor asks each factory for every fee tier / tick spacing, verifies each pool (code present, token0/token1 match, decimals match) and keeps the one with the most in-range liquidity. 'expected' is a documentation cross-check only.",
    "Cost assumptions (bridge bps, fixed USD, swap gas) are estimates, not live quotes. See the doc for where they come from and how to change them."
  ],
  "intervalMs": 15000,
  "resolveEveryMin": 360,
  "notionalUsd": 10000,
  "minNetBps": 0,
  "outDir": "data/fleet",
  "spreadsFile": "xchain-spreads.jsonl",
  "metricsFile": "xchain-monitor.fleet-metrics.json",
  "maxFileMb": 64,
